      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;">Due to the nature of the liability amounts previously reported in account 223, corporate management has reclassed these transactions to 234 to adhere to FERC rules supporting these accounts.</span>
